        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>三、函数 - 性质总结</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" defer></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #cfe0f0;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"STSong\", serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    max-width: 800px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 6px solid #3b6fc4;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    padding: 30px 34px 40px 34px;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .badge {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 70px;\n    height: 70px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #3b6fc4;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    text-align: center;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    z-index: 5;\n  }\n  .badge.top-right { top: -25px; right: -25px; }\n  .badge.bottom-left { bottom: -25px; left: -25px; }\n\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    color: rgba(150,180,220,0.35);\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    transform: rotate(-25deg);\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    z-index: 1;\n    user-select: none;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .wm1 { top: 42%; left: 18%; }\n  .wm2 { top: 68%; left: 30%; font-size: 30px; }\n\n  .content { position: relative; z-index: 2; }\n\n  h2.title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  p.para {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    margin: 4px 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  p.section-label {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    margin: 4px 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  table {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    width: 100%;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  table td, table th {\n    border: 1px solid #000;\n    padding: 4px 6px;\n    text-align: center;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  td.label {\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    text-orientation: upright;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    width: 26px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  td.leftalign {\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  h3.subhead {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    margin: 6px 0 8px 0;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #888;\n    background: #fafafa;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #666;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 6px auto;\n  }\n  .flow-box {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n    background: #fff;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .flow-wrap {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    padding: 10px 0;\n  }\n  .flow-arrow {\n    font-size: 16px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"badge top-right\">@哈啰<br>高职生</div>\n  <div class=\"badge bottom-left\">@哈喽<br>高职生</div>\n  <div class=\"watermark wm1\">高职生</div>\n  <div class=\"watermark wm2\">哈喽高职生</div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n\n    <h2 class=\"title\">三、函数</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"para\">\n      1.概念: A、B为两个非空实数集,对于集合A中任意取x,在集合B中都有唯一确定的数值与之对应,就称f(x)是A到B的函数。\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"section-label\">2.性质:</p>\n\n    <table>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"label\">定义域</td>\n        <td class=\"leftalign\">一次函数、二次函数,x∈R</td>\n        <td class=\"leftalign\">反比例函数x≠0</td>\n        <td class=\"leftalign\">对数函数x&gt;0</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"label\" rowspan=\"2\">值域</td>\n        <td class=\"leftalign\">一次函数：y=kx+b(k≠0)<br>y∈R</td>\n        <td class=\"leftalign\">反比例函数：y=$\\frac{k}{x}$(k≠0)<br>∈ (-∞, 0) ∪ (0, +∞)</td>\n        <td class=\"leftalign\">二次函数：y=ax²<br>+bx+c(a,b,c为常数且a≠0)<br>y看开口方向和对称性</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"leftalign\">指数函数y=aˣ (a&gt;0且a≠1)<br>y∈ (0, +∞)</td>\n        <td class=\"leftalign\">对数函数log<sub>a</sub>x (a&gt;0且a≠1)<br>y∈R</td>\n        <td></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"label\">单调性</td>\n        <td class=\"leftalign\">\n          x₁&lt;x₂ f(x₁)&lt;f(x₂)⟺f(x)是增函数<br>\n          $\\frac{f(x_1)-f(x_2)}{x_1-x_2}$&gt;0⟺f(x)是增函数\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"leftalign\">\n          x₁&lt;x₂ f(x₁)&gt;f(x₂)⟺f(x)是减函数<br>\n          $\\frac{f(x_1)-f(x_2)}{x_1-x_2}$&lt;0⟺f(x)是减函数\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"leftalign\">复合函数y=f(g(x))　同增异减</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"label\">奇偶性</td>\n        <td class=\"leftalign\" colspan=\"2\">\n          f(-x)=f(x)⟺f(x)是偶函数⟺图像关于y轴对称,对称轴x=$\\frac{a+b}{2}$\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"leftalign\">\n          f(-x)=-f(x)⟺f(x)是奇函数⟺图像关于原点对称,对称中心($\\frac{a+b}{2}$,0)\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"label\">零点</td>\n        <td colspan=\"3\">\n          <div class=\"flow-wrap\">\n            <span class=\"flow-box\">函数图象与x轴<br>有交点<br>y=f(x)</span>\n            <span class=\"flow-arrow\">⟺</span>\n            <span class=\"flow-box\">函数y=f(x)图象与x轴有交点</span>\n            <span class=\"flow-arrow\">⟺</span>\n            <span class=\"flow-box\">方程f(x)=0有实数根</span>\n          </div>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n\n    <p class=\"section-label\">3. 幂函数</p>\n\n    <h3 class=\"subhead\">3.2　五个幂函数的图象</h3>\n    <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:280px;height:150px;\">\n      [Diagram: 五个幂函数图象, 坐标系, 曲线束, 中央位置]\n    </div>\n\n    <h3 class=\"subhead\">3.3　五个幂函数的性质</h3>\n    <table>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"label\">幂函数</td>\n        <td>y=x</td>\n        <td>y=x²</td>\n        <td>y=x³</td>\n        <td>y=x<sup>1/2</sup></td>\n        <td>y=x<sup>-1</sup></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"label\">定义域</td>\n        <td>R</td>\n        <td>R</td>\n        <td>R</td>\n        <td>[0,+∞)</td>\n        <td>(-∞,0)∪(0,+∞)</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"label\">值域</td>\n        <td>R</td>\n        <td>[0,+∞)</td>\n        <td>R</td>\n        <td>[0,+∞)</td>\n        <td>(-∞,0)∪(0,+∞)</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"label\">奇偶性</td>\n        <td>奇</td>\n        <td>偶</td>\n        <td>奇</td>\n        <td>非奇非偶</td>\n        <td>奇</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"label\">单调性</td>\n        <td>增</td>\n        <td>x∈[0,+∞)增<br>x∈(-∞,0]减</td>\n        <td>增</td>\n        <td>增</td>\n        <td>x∈(-∞,0)减<br>x∈(0,+∞)减</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"label\">公共点</td>\n        <td colspan=\"5\">(1,1)</td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
